"coluna «Outras» vale para as marcas sem coluna própria."
msgstr ""
"You quote in <b>¥ (RMB)</b>. The platform converts to US$ only for the "
"seller to read — the data is always your ¥. <b>eMCP, uMCP, LPDDR, eMMC and "
"UFS</b> have a single price for every brand; <b>DDR</b> is priced per brand,"
" and the «Other» column covers brands with no column of their own."

